    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy just feels like another way to delay the inevitable. it's like putting a bandaid on something that's just fundamentally wrong. i look at people and i see them actually living, actually helping, and then i look at myself and i just see this... debt. i feel like i'm living on borrowed time that i don't deserve. do you think some people are just born with that kind of darkness in them? like they're just meant to be a void?",
